<description>&lt;p&gt;A fire on Phuket island killed 11 people and injured dozens, prompting an investigation into its cause. Cambodian leaders voiced concern over border tensions with Thailand and adopted a declaration in Phnom Penh, while Thailand objected to Cambodia's wording on displaced people at an ASEAN meeting. Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet thanked France and Macron for efforts to resolve the border dispute, and the Thai army accused Cambodia of politicising a border temple display. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5mUXh6N2lob1dQS1JTdmtFRW9QMjVNSF9iekhhaFBLQTIyOHZiSnUtQ0tRX1BoczZhR2l5WXJsUGJVRHNNVlBUbUQyUVV2T3c4ZDg2RXRLV3FUYWZpQVNZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNMlV4NFF3NmlmMklhVnRlSS1vclFEbkcyNkI5YVl4Rmwwc01mWW1rVzIzd21LaE9QR2xwUkhGXzlqQng2RVljMnRGbXMzSDh3V3lsWlplaTlHendQWk1GUi02c1JrUnNSSUoyREk2OHN5VUp5eDQ1eXVITjQ5Uk5uTUhUU1QxQ25KV25PRm5WZDVreXU4MlJhMnJXZXl2ZTc0akhmSlRNSnhsM1dNWG5jZkZ2MEc?oc=5&quot;&gt;nenews.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Malay Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPb2dfTzZSWm1hZUQzWlR5M1VsV1pWaTFDZmJCbG1NQjBmYW5tc0k2TURxdGRINXdNOG45NnRoRnAzSlFRYnVqUXRhRkVERTJISndmWHpLMk5NVTdmMjE5S0xYcHZiTElodnhVT1N0bGNnYndmZ001cjhFaGNpNnpVNzllRnNHVFNnS1BpMTVnSTRrZmQ1QlhfdVdTQ0xwMjI4QWNrcF9SRGdnR3VFSEcwVnF1YkJjMHZjcV9KV0d0Z1RtOG8xX1VTRC1YRllUZw?oc=5&q